---
import site from '../data/site.json';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="bg-ink text-white">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 px-4 py-14 md:grid-cols-3 md:px-6">
    <div>
      <img src="/images/logo-cyan.png" alt="GRITTY" class="h-6 w-auto" />
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/70">
        {site.company_name}<br />
        {site.address}<br />
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="text-cyan hover:underline">{site.email}</a>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="font-en text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-cyan">Sitemap</p>
      <nav class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm text-white/80" aria-label="フッターナビゲーション">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-cyan">ホーム</a>
        <a href="/services/" class="hover:text-cyan">事業内容</a>
        <a href="/company/" class="hover:text-cyan">会社概要</a>
        <a href="/news/" class="hover:text-cyan">ニュース</a>
        <a href="/contact/" class="hover:text-cyan">お問い合わせ</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="font-en text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-cyan">Contact</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/70">
        測定・分析のご相談は公式LINEからどうぞ。通常1営業日以内に返信します。
      </p>
      <a href={site.line_url} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="mt-4 inline-block rounded bg-[#06C755] px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-white transition hover:opacity-90">LINEで友だち追加</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="border-t border-white/10 py-5 text-center text-xs text-white/50">
    © {year} GRITTY Inc.
  </div>
</footer>
